   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Profile Follow Card\n\nA creator profile card springs in, its parts blur in one after another, then a cursor glides to the button and clicks it, flipping Follow to Following.\n\nCategory: social. Length: 5.5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Showcasing a single creator profile with a click-to-follow payoff as the action beat.\n- A social-proof or creator-intro scene needs one profile card with a cursor interaction.\n- You want an offline-safe card (gradient cover, initial avatar) with no image URLs.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You are showing follower growth or notifications rather than one profile: use followers-overview.\n- You need a testimonial or quote card: compose a plain card.\n- A count-up milestone is the point: use milestone-counter-list.\n\nVariables:\n- name (string): Name, default \"Studio Nova\"\n- handle (string): Handle, default \"studionova\"\n- bio (string): Bio, default \"Making small, useful tools for video teams.\\nShipping demos faster with ready-made motion.\"\n- location (string): Location, default \"Lisbon\"\n- website (string): Website, default \"studionova.example\"\n- joined (string): Joined, default \"January 2024\"\n- verified (boolean): Check mark, default true\n- follow_label (string): Follow label, default \"Follow\"\n- following_label (string): Following label, default \"Following\"\n- tabs (string): Tabs, default \"Posts, Media, About\"\n- post_text (string): Sample post, default \"Shipping something new today. Built entirely with a lot of coffee. More soon.\"\n- orientation (enum): Orientation, default \"auto\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#7c5cff\"\n- theme (enum): Theme, default \"light\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
